Metadata-Version: 2.1
Name: labkey
Version: 2.4.0
Summary: Stand-in for the LabKey Python client, for the Research Environment training simulator
License: Apache License 2.0
Requires-Python: >=3.6

A stand-in for the "labkey" Python client used in the Research Environment training
simulator. select_rows, execute_sql and QueryFilter answer from the simulator's copy
of the data browser's tables after checking ~/.netrc as the real server would. It is
not the labkey package of LabKey Corporation.
